                "comment": "I really enjoyed his class. It was pretty easy and mostly writing assignments. We do lots of peer reviews, and he gives thorough feedback quickly. He grades generously. Participation is mandatory, but I only spoke a few times and still got an A. Just show up and do the work. He is a nice guy and truly cares about his students.\n",
